  "note": "4C: the original May-2010 incidents complete the set. The ghost haunts one guest room at a time (blocks it like a fire) and only the GHOSTBUSTER phone call clears it — tapping does nothing, exactly the original. Heat waves and cold snaps are hotel-wide: guests pay half while the hotel is uncomfortable, the REPAIR call ends it for a fee, or the weather passes on its own after durationSec. Chances, fees and the 8-hour duration are our tuning; the incidents, the phone, and who-fixes-what are the documented original. vipArrival removed in 3B with the vip guest type (decision 13a)."
